{
  "updatedAt": "2026-09-02T19:33:07.750Z",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-02T18:25:26.676Z",
  "id": "IwfJw0DHAtyd1cEE",
  "name": "[GitHub] Gmail AI Triage",
  "description": "Polls Gmail for unread emails, classifies each one using a local Ollama model, and routes by category: urgent (label), meeting (label), newsletter (mark as read).",
  "active": false,
  "isArchived": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "filters": {
          "readStatus": "unread"
        }
      },
      "id": "5acdfddc-56a8-44a0-9658-3ea3f846760c",
      "name": "New Email Received",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        0,
        192
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ 'From: ' + $json.from + '\\nSubject: ' + $json.subject + '\\nPreview: ' + $json.snippet }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an email classification assistant. Classify incoming emails into exactly one of these four categories:\n- urgent: Needs immediate action, time-sensitive, from a real person (not automated)\n- meeting: Calendar invite, scheduling request, or meeting-related email\n- newsletter: Marketing, promotional, subscription, or automated digest email\n- other: Everything else\n\nAlways respond with JSON only, using the exact key \"category\". Example: {\"category\": \"urgent\"}"
        }
      },
      "id": "b7ec14fd-7bb0-4bf7-943e-3eaadfb51770",
      "name": "Classify Email",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        224,
        192
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "qwen2.5:7b",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.1
        }
      },
      "id": "370ef291-cbfb-4c27-b2d8-0f9e2ed302ad",
      "name": "Ollama Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOllama",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        224,
        416
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "ollamaApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Ollama account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsonSchemaExample": "{\"category\": \"urgent\"}"
      },
      "id": "700bec2b-55c7-4fd7-b559-0ae7c020815a",
      "name": "Category Parser",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        368,
        416
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose",
                  "version": 1
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.output.category }}",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    },
                    "rightValue": "urgent"
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              }
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose",
                  "version": 1
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.output.category }}",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    },
                    "rightValue": "meeting"
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              }
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose",
                  "version": 1
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.output.category }}",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    },
                    "rightValue": "newsletter"
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra",
          "renameFallbackOutput": "other"
        }
      },
      "id": "6c99e8fe-3efb-4174-86c9-89cf61ec986f",
      "name": "Route by Category",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        576,
        176
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "addLabels",
        "messageId": "={{ $('New Email Received').item.json.id }}",
        "labelIds": [
          "YOUR_URGENT_LABEL_ID"
        ]
      },
      "id": "44ed9882-e3a9-4331-a63e-70ce51df9cf2",
      "name": "Label: Urgent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        800,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "086be613-5d15-4388-a4a3-24d3b9d52dc2"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "addLabels",
        "messageId": "={{ $('New Email Received').item.json.id }}",
        "labelIds": [
          "YOUR_MEETING_LABEL_ID"
        ]
      },
      "id": "03efa11e-c519-4b5a-9e9c-76773cff32f0",
      "name": "Label: Meeting",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        800,
        192
      ],
      "webhookId": "a0e64810-792d-42af-9436-b3e3f5177418"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "markAsRead",
        "messageId": "={{ $('New Email Received').item.json.id }}"
      },
      "id": "df68639d-5c91-4657-b8ab-fc7bd37f27c8",
      "name": "Mark Newsletter as Read",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        800,
        384
      ],
      "webhookId": "d9b1a411-6694-481f-8310-d931ae0b912c"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Gmail AI Triage\n\nMonitors your Gmail inbox for unread emails, classifies each one using a local Ollama model, and automatically applies labels or marks them as read.\n\n**Categories:**\n- **urgent** \u2014 applies your Urgent label\n- **meeting** \u2014 applies your Meeting label\n- **newsletter** \u2014 marks as read\n- **other** \u2014 no action taken\n\nPolls every minute. Only processes unread emails.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "64d392ae-b072-4061-b094-3a7531f673b0",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Prerequisites\n\n**Gmail** OAuth2 credential connected in n8n\n\n**Ollama** running locally:\n- `qwen2.5:7b` \u2014 runs the email classification\n- Pull with: `ollama pull qwen2.5:7b`\n- Default URL: `http://localhost:11434`\n\n**Gmail labels** created before activating:\n- Open Gmail \u2192 Settings \u2192 Labels \u2192 Create label\n- Create labels for Urgent and Meeting (or your preferred names)",
        "height": 346,
        "width": 600,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "f99a2ca3-01b1-48ff-9513-e39c82f66784",
      "name": "Prerequisites",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -208
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Configuration\n\n**Label IDs** \u2014 In *Label: Urgent* and *Label: Meeting* nodes:\n\u2192 Open each Gmail node \u2192 click the label field \u2192 select your label from the dropdown (this replaces the placeholder automatically)\n\nOr find the ID manually:\n\u2192 Gmail Settings \u2192 Labels \u2192 hover a label \u2192 check the URL\n\n**Poll interval** \u2014 Change *New Email Received* trigger (default: every minute)\n\n**Add categories** \u2014 Edit the *Route by Category* Switch node to add new rules, then connect new Gmail nodes as additional branches",
        "height": 476,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "7aa90f80-11e5-41c0-92e9-e5c50e4048f6",
      "name": "Configuration",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1024,
        0
      ]
    }
  ],
